{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28295","headline":"早春阁下寓直萧九舍人亦直内署因寄书怀四韵 · 杜牧","name":"早春阁下寓直萧九舍人亦直内署因寄书怀四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御水初销冻，宫花尚怯寒。\n千峰横紫翠，双阙凭阑干。\n玉漏轻风顺，金茎淡日残。\n王乔在何处，清汉正骖鸾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}